#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A technical, black-and-white hosting theme for VPS, dedicated, cloud and game server providers. Square-edged design with a terminal-green accent, mega menus, animated product scenes, plan tables with GBP/USD switching, data-centre maps, light/dark mode and a GDPR cookie banner. Works out of the box, and is fully compatible with the block editor, Elementor and WooCommerce. Install the RMDHost Core plugin for server plans, Elementor widgets and one-click demo import."
